 "purpose": "Review benchmark (pre-registration version 4): human, AI and AI-then-human-edited academic and student writing, one review call per document. Labels are the datasets' own claims; Lectern did not verify authorship. Texts are not in this file or in git: they are in bench/data/review (git-ignored).",
